[2026-06-12 14:36:46] [claude-sdk] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013RcK5zxV5BYsLXxBHXBKXe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed. Here's what changed:\n\n**Before:** the button just did `style.display='flex'` inline, which showed the links as a horizontal row inside the nav bar — no vertical dropdown at all.\n\n**Now:**\n- **Vertical dropdown** — on mobile, `.nav-links` is absolutely positioned below the nav, full-width, with `flex-direction: column`. Each link gets its own row with a divider line, sized for easy tap targets (17px font, 14px padding).\n- **Frosted glass backdrop** — matches the sticky header (dark translucent + blur).\n- **Toggle open/close** — the ≡ button toggles to ✕ when the menu is open, and toggles the `.open` class (no more inline style hacks).\n- **Auto-close on link tap** — clicking any nav link closes the dropdown and resets the button, also clears any leftover inline styles so CSS takes back over cleanly."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":112,"cache_read_input_tokens":77158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":112},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2412286a-a323-40f9-81bf-c3c5703205ab","uuid":"eab9db93-17d6-4c03-8546-e964b28f0975"}
