[2026-06-12 18:52:04] [claude-sdk] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EiadYA5FYRN31WoQU5imeb","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the login page. Let me create a summary of my findings.\n\n## Summary: Web Portal Login Page Component\n\nI found the login page component in the core-frontend application. Here are the key details:\n\n### Main Files Located\n\n**Component Files:**\n- `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/features/auth/components/LoginForm/LoginForm.jsx` - Main login form component\n- `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/features/auth/components/LoginForm/login.css` - Login page styling\n- `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/features/auth/AuthRoutes.jsx` - Auth routing\n\n**Asset Files:**\n- `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/assets/brand.png` - Brand logo used in login form\n- `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/assets/logo.png` - Alternative logo\n- `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/assets/brand-white.png` - White variant for different backgrounds\n\n### Branding Area Styling\n\nThe login form features a professional branding section with the following styling:\n\n**Logo Display (`.login-brand`):**\n- Max-width: 60px\n- Centered with auto margins\n- Bottom margin: 1.5rem for spacing\n\n**Security Badge (`.auth-badge`):**\n- Displays \"Secure Login\" text with animated pulsing dot\n- Background: `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.08)` (light blue)\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.2)`\n- Text color: Uses `--secondary-color` (#2690bc)\n- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans, 12px, 600 weight, uppercase\n- Padding: 6px 14px\n- Border-radius: 20px\n- Animated dot with pulse animation (2s infinite)\n\n**Page Title (`.auth-page-title`):**\n- \"Welcome Back\" heading\n- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans, 32px, 800 weight\n- Color: #1a2332\n- Letter-spacing: -0.5px\n- Negative margin-bottom: -20px for layout adjustment\n\n**Description Message (`.login-message`):**\n- Font-size: 15px\n- Color: #64748b (slate gray)\n- Line-height: 24px\n- Margin-bottom: 32px\n\n### Color Scheme\n\n**CSS Variables (defined in `/Users/andrewprice/senturi/core/core-frontend/src/App.css`):**\n- `--primary-color`: #37aa7a (green)\n- `--secondary-color`: #2690bc (blue)\n- `--primary-gradient`: Linear gradient from blue (#2690bc) to green (#37aa7a)\n- `--text-color`: #2f5064\n\n### Overall Layout\n\n**Login Form Container (`.login-form`):**\n- Max-width: 480px\n- Background: #ffffff (white)\n- Padding: 48px 40px\n- Border-radius: 20px\n- Box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -9.6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)\n- Border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.6)\n\n**Page Background (`.login-page`):**\n- Gradient: `linear-gradient(135deg, #fafbfc 0%, #ffffff 50%, rgba(55, 170, 122, 0.03) 100%)`\n- Min-height: 100vh\n- Centered layout with flexbox\n\n**Input Fields:**\n- Padding: 13px 0.75rem 13px 48px (with left space for icons)\n- Border-radius: 10px\n- Border: 1.5px solid #e8eaed\n- Focus state: Border color changes to `--secondary-color` (#2690bc) with box-shadow\n\n**Sign In Button:**\n- Background: Linear gradient from `--secondary-color` to `--primary-color`\n- Padding: 18px\n- Border-radius: 10px\n- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans, 16px, 600 weight\n- Box-shadow: 0 3.2px 11.2px 0 rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.3)\n- Hover effect: Inverts gradient with enhanced shadow\n\n### Fonts Used\n- **Headings:** Plus Jakarta Sans (400, 500, 600, 700, 800 weights)\n- **Branding text:** Montserrat (900 weight) - used on gradient background\n- **Body:** Plus Jakarta Sans\n\nThe login page uses a clean, modern design with a white form card centered on a subtle gradient background, featuring Senturi's brand colors (green and blue) in buttons and accent elements."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab312fcf-52d9-4bfd-b9f5-2b71e9f3b92d","uuid":"47af1ce1-66d6-4cff-8222-8006df45be9e","timestamp":"2026-06-12T23:52:04.090Z",