th Badge Background: `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.08)`\n- Input Focus Shadow: `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.1)`\n- Icon Background: `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.08)`\n- Logout Success Background: `rgba(55, 170, 122, 0.08)`\n- Logout Success Border: `rgba(55, 170, 122, 0.2)`\n\n**Hero Background**\n- Hero Container: `#0c1d27` (Very Dark Navy)\n- Glow/Accent: `rgba(38, 182, 137, 1)` → fading variants\n- Light Segment: `rgba(38, 182, 137, 0.5)`, `rgba(38, 182, 137, 0)` (gradient)\n\n**Chart Colors**\n- Circular Progress Path: `url(#gradient)` with stops `#498fb7` → `#5aa77e`\n- Circular Progress Trail: `#eef1f6`\n- Circular Progress Text: `#223e4f`\n- Area Chart Colors: `#2f5064`, `#00a4b6`, `#00b390`\n\n---\n\n### TYPOGRAPHY\n\n**Font Families**\n- Primary Font: `\"Euclid Circular B\"` (loaded from senturi.io)\n  - Fallback: `Poppins`, `system-ui`, `-apple-system`, `\"Segoe UI\"`, `Roboto`, `\"Helvetica Neue\"`, `Arial`, `sans-serif`\n- Secondary Font (Auth Pages): `\"Plus Jakarta Sans\"` (Google Fonts)\n- Branding Font: `\"Montserrat\"` (Google Fonts)\n- Monospace (Tables): `ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", \"Courier New\"`\n\n**Font Weights**\n- Light: 300\n- Regular: 400\n- Medium: 500\n- Semi-Bold: 600\n- Bold: 700\n- Extra Bold: 900 (branding only)\n\n**Font Sizes**\n- XS: 12px\n- Small: 13-14px\n- Base: 15px\n- Body: 16px\n- Larger Body: 20px\n- Headers: 22px, 30px, 32px\n- Page Title: 35px\n- Branding: 105-110px (Montserrat, 900 weight)\n- Login Form: 16px, 18px\n\n**Line Heights**\n- Branding: 85px, 92px\n- Heading: 1\n- Body: 1.75\n- Compact: 22px, 23px\n\n**Letter Spacing**\n- Branding: -2px\n- Headings: -0.8px, -1px\n- Auth Page Titles: -0.5px\n- Standard: normal or -0.05em\n\n---\n\n### SPACING & SIZING\n\n**Card/Component Padding**\n- Standard Padding: 20px\n- Half Padding: 10px\n- Double Padding: 40px\n- Compact: 6px, 8px, 12px, 14px\n\n**Margins**\n- Gap/Space: 1rem, 8px, 10px, 20px\n- Top margins on headings: -20px to -7px (compression)\n\n**Height Values**\n- Header: 61px (fixed)\n- Sidebar: 100vh (full height)\n- Card: 155px (tombstone cards)\n- Icon: 35-44px (buttons/avatars)\n- Security Item: 60px\n\n**Width Values**\n- Max Container: 1200px\n- Sidebar Expanded: 200px\n- Sidebar Collapsed: 80px\n- Sidebar Mobile: 60px\n- SlideOut Panel: 600px\n- Login Form Max: 480px\n- Register Container: 60% (desktop), 100% (mobile)\n\n---\n\n### BORDERS & BORDER-RADIUS\n\n**Border Radius Values**\n- `var(--border-radius)`: 6px (root CSS variable)\n- Small: 3-5px\n- Medium: 8px\n- Button/Input: 10px, 20px\n- Circular: 50%\n- Compact: 4px\n\n**Border Colors & Styles**\n- Border Color: `#f7f7f7` (var(--border-color))\n- Border: `1px solid var(--border-color)`\n- Input Border: `1.5px solid #e8eaed` (on focus: `var(--secondary-color)`)\n- Form Border: `1px solid #ccc`, `1px solid #d8dee4`\n- Table Border: `1px solid #e0e6ee`\n- Table Divider: `1px solid #f2f4f8`\n- Dashed Border: `2px dashed #dbe0e8` (empty state)\n\n---\n\n### SHADOWS\n\n**Shadow Values**\n- Main Shadow: `0px 2px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / 1%)` (or 6% variant in commented code)\n- Header/Card: `0px 2px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / 20%)`\n- Modal: `0 20px 40px -9.6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)`\n- Button Hover: `0 6.4px 19.2px 0 rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.5)`\n- Button Default: `0 3.2px 11.2px 0 rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.3)`\n- Floating Card: `0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)`\n- SlideOut: `-2px 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)`\n- Gradient Box (Login): `0 20px 40px -9.6px rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.25)`\n- Notify: `0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)`\n\n---\n\n### TRANSITIONS & ANIMATIONS\n\n**Transition Variables (CSS)**\n- `--tran-01`: `all 0.1s ease`\n- `--tran-02`: `all 0.2s ease`\n- `--tran-03`: `all 0.3s ease`\n- `--tran-04`: `all 0.4s ease`\n- `--tran-05`: `all 0.5s ease`\n\n**Duration: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)** (standard easing for buttons, inputs)\n\n**Animations**\n- `slideInLeft`: 0.5s ease-out\n- `slideIn` / `slideOut`: 0.3s ease-in/out (SlideOut panel)\n- `floatCard1` / `floatCard2`: 3-3.5s ease-in-out infinite (floating cards)\n- `pulse`: 2s infinite (auth badge)\n- `moveDown`: 3s linear forwards (hero background)\n- `moveCircle1` / `moveCircle2`: 10s ease-in-out infinite (hero background)\n- `Gradient`: 13s ease infinite (register form button)\n\n---\n\n### COMPONENT-SPECIFIC STYLES\n\n**Buttons**\n- Default Button: \n  - Gradient: `linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary-color), var(--primary-color))`\n  - Padding: 18px\n  - Border-radius: 10px\n  - Font Weight: 600\n  - Font Size: 16px\n  - Box Shadow: `0 3.2px 11.2px 0 rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.3)`\n  - Hover Shadow: `0 6.4px 19.2px 0 rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.5)`\n  - Hover Transform: `translateY(-2px)`\n\n**Inputs**\n- Padding: 13px 0.75rem (login), 0.75rem 20px (forms)\n- Border: 1.5px solid #e8eaed\n- Border-radius: 10px (login), 6px (forms)\n- Focus: Border becomes `var(--secondary-color)`\n- Focus Shadow: `0 0 0 3px rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.1)`\n- Placeholder: `#9ca3af`\n- Text Color: `#1a2332`\n\n**Tables**\n- Padding: 12px 14px (cells), 8px 16px (asset table)\n- Border: 1px solid #e0e6ee\n- Header Background: #f5f7fa\n- Header Font Weight: 600\n- Row Hover: #f0f7ff\n- Alternating Rows: #fafcff\n\n**Navigation Links**\n- Padding: 0.75rem 1rem\n- Font Size: 0.95rem\n- Hover: Background becomes `var(--primary-light-color)`, color becomes `var(--primary-color)`\n- Border Radius (hover): 5px\n- Collapsed: 0.85rem padding\n\n**Cards**\n- Background: `#fff`\n- Border-radius: 5-6px\n- Box Shadow: `var(--shadow-main)`\n- Padding: 20px (standard)\n- Border: 1px solid `var(--border-color)`\n\n**Modals**\n- Overlay Background: `#879aa26b` with `backdrop-filter: blur(2px)`\n- Content Background: `#fff`\n- Content Padding: 10px 30px 20px 30px\n- Border-radius: 5px\n- Text Color: `#3c5055`\n\n---\n\n### SPECIFIC PAGE STYLING\n\n**Login Page**\n- Background: `linear-gradient(135deg, #fafbfc 0%, #ffffff 50%, rgba(55, 170, 122, 0.03) 100%)`\n- Form Background: `#ffffff`\n- Form Padding: 48px 40px\n- Form Border-radius: 20px\n- Form Border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.6)\n- Gradient Box: `linear-gradient(135deg, #2690bc, #37aa7a)` with shadow `0 20px 40px -9.6px rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.25)`\n- Badge Background: `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.08)` with border `rgba(38, 144, 188, 0.2)`\n- Label: 14px, font-weight 600, `#1a2332`\n- Message: 15px, font-weight 400, `#64748b`\n\n**Dashboard**\n- Max Width: 1200px\n- Tombstone Container: Gap 20px, flex layout\n- Tombstone Empty Border: 2px dashed #dbe0e8\n- Device Status Font: 12px\n\n**Profile**\n- Container Width: 85%\n- Container Background: `#fff`\n- Container Padding: 20px\n- Mobile: Full width, full height, fixed positioning\n\n**Register**\n- Main Container: 60% width\n- Form Padding: 40px\n- Column Gap: 40px\n- Overlay: `#879aa26b` with blur\n- Animated Button: 13s animation with color cycling\n\n---\n\n### RESPONSIVE DESIGN BREAKPOINTS\n\n- Desktop: 1024px+ (full sidebar 200px)\n- Tablet: 768px-1023px (sidebar collapses to 60px)\n- Mobile: < 768px (various adjustments)\n- Extra Wide: 1100px (register layout changes)\n\n---\n\n### ICON & COMPONENT LIBRARIES\n\n- **Boxicons**: `@2.1.4` (imported from unpkg)\n- **Lucide React**: Used for SVG icons in components\n- **Material-UI**: Button, LinearProgress, Box, Typography\n- **Recharts**: Area charts, responsive containers\n- **React Circular Progressbar**: Circular progress with gradients\n\n---\n\n### FILTER & EFFECT VALUES\n\n- Blur (backdrop-filter): 2px, 3px, 10px\n- Blur (filter): 75px (hero background glows)\n- Opacity (animations): 0-1 with various easing\n\n---\n\nThis design system encompasses the complete visual identity needed to replicate the Senturi web application in a React Native environment. All hex codes, font metrics, spacing values, and shadows are extracted directly from the CSS files."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab312fcf-52d9-4bfd-b9f5-2b71e9f3b92d","uuid":"daba3d64-b3ca-4748-9b2a-f0d3d71e8856","timestamp":"2026-06-12T23:58:24.591Z","tool_u