[2026-06-12 19:15:20] [claude-sdk] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01U9tBpfyUWjrftvxcgMCqi3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is confirming that the CPU, memory, and disk data is still not coming through on the asset page. Since I already fixed the LinearGradient issue in the UtilBar, the problem must be deeper - likely in the data fetching/unwrapping logic.\n\nLet me trace the data flow more carefully:\n\n1. `getAssetSummary(assetId)` in superopsService.js does:\n   ```js\n   const res = await apiClient.post('/api/v1/superops/get-asset-summary', { assetId });\n   return res.data;\n   ```\n   \n   Axios automatically unwraps the HTTP response, so `res.data` is the JSON body: `{ success: true, data: <gqlResult> }`. But what is `<gqlResult>`? The backend service returns the raw GraphQL response object, which has its own `data` wrapper: `{ data: { getAssetSummary: { cpu: {...}, memory: {...}, disk: {...} } } }`. So the controller wraps it as `{ success: true, data: { data: { getAssetSummary: ... } } }` - there's a double nesting happening here.\n\nWhen the component receives this response, it tries to extract the summary data. It first unwraps one layer with `summaryRes.value?.data`, getting the inner GraphQL response object. Then it attempts to access `getAssetSummary` directly, but that's still nested under another `data` property, so it falls back to the entire object instead of the actual summary data.\n\nThis means `summary` ends up being `{ data: { getAssetSummary: { cpu, memory, disk } } }` instead of just the asset metrics, so when the component tries to read `summary?.cpu`, it gets undefined and displays empty bars everywhere.\n\nThe confusing part is that this should have been broken from the start, unless the backend service is actually unwrapping the GraphQL response layer before returning it. I need to look at the actual backend code to understand what's really being returned.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":121,"cache_read_input_tokens":112616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":121},"output_tokens":36,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab312fcf-52d9-4bfd-b9f5-2b71e9f3b92d","uuid":"f68c7d4e-2810-4f44-b4e5-987f18b0a65a"}
