ptBannerEnd</p></div></div><p>We agree that ChatGPT Ads are an exciting opportunity and are definitely interested in exploring the channel further.</p><p>Before reallocating budget, however, we’d like to connect with Brad and Jarrod to make sure it aligns with the broader strategy and priorities already in place.</p><p>From our perspective, the bigger opportunity right now is ensuring the website, content, tracking, and overall digital foundation are properly positioned for where search and consumer behavior are headed. While being an early adopter can be beneficial, long-term success will ultimately come from having the right foundation in place to convert and measure traffic regardless of the channel.</p><p> Let us discuss with Brad and Jarrod first and then determine the best path forward.</p><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div></div><div id=\\\"x_x_x_x_ms-outlook-mobile-signature\\\"><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">--</p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Thanks,</p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Andrew</p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Andrew Price | COO</p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">The Cajas Digital Agency</p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/www.cajasdigital.com__;!!COskAx4!Dgxc4CXC9Z1G1qqbdCSqHsSWp37Ao5Col_EKjlrNc0U9mrAtuRoH94OjFKXDFHE-kfQU6eoKxc7MAClyemX1sYZFuAo$\\\">www.cajasdigital.com</a></p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:Andrew@CajasDigital.com\\\">Andrew@CajasDigital.com</a></p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">m.) 225.323.1120 (Text Friendly)</p></div></div></div><div id=\\\"x_x_x_x_mail-editor-reference-message-container\\\"><div style=\\\"border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in;border-co