l\\\">ZjQcmQRYFpfptBannerStart</p></div><table class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"width:100.0%\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"padding:0in 0in 7.5pt 0in\\\"><table class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"width:100.0%;background:#D0D8DC;border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 3.0pt;border-color:currentcolor;border-radius:4px\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"border:none;padding:0in 6.0pt 4.5pt 6.0pt\\\"><table class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormalTable\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"padding:0in 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"line-height:15.0pt\\\"><b>[CAUTION] *EXTERNAL TO SCORPION*</b></p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding:0in 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">ZjQcmQRYFpfptBannerEnd</p></div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_wordsection1\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\\\">Thanks for sharing. We will circle back on this as we have been deeply engaged on AI. Before we redirect any of the budget let us talk with Brad and Jarrod. Andrew is best to ask however what steps have been included to prep the website to stay forward on the AI initiative. I know it’s a lift on your side to prep so however we can help there as well.</p><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div id=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div></div><div id=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_ms-outlook-mobile-signature\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Joseph Cajas</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">President </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">The Cajas Digital Agency</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">512-961-2778 mbl </p></div></div><div class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align:center\\\"><hr /></div><div id=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_divRpl