:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in;border-color:currentcolor\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><b>From: </b>Spencer Lincoln &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:Spencer.Lincoln@scorpion.co\\\">Spencer.Lincoln@scorpion.co</a>&gt;<br /><b>Date: </b>Tuesday, June 16, 2026 at 2:37 PM<br /><b>To: </b>Jarrod Smith &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:jarrod@smithandvinson.com\\\">jarrod@smithandvinson.com</a>&gt;<br /><b>Cc: </b>Brad Vinson &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:brad@smithandvinson.com\\\">brad@smithandvinson.com</a>&gt;; Andrew Price &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:andrew@cajasdigital.com\\\">andrew@cajasdigital.com</a>&gt;<br /><b>Subject: </b>ChatGPT Ads</p></div></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Hey Guys,</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">As I’m sure you’ve heard, OpenAI has finally rolled out advertising for its product and the door’s now open for legal advertising.  With next month resuming the budget for PPC at $5k, it’d be a good opportunity for us to test the waters and see if we can generate some leads from that platform.</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">I’m going to have the team run a campaign next month with $2,000 in budget applied to it so that we can at the very least see what it produces for us.  I think it’ll certainly be much more cost effective than Google PPC, and over time could be a good produced of PI leads. </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">We’ll keep you posted. </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><table class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"width:307.5pt\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"width:335.25pt;padding:15.0pt 0in 15.0pt 0in\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><b>Spencer Lincoln</b></p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Senior Director of Account Management</p></div><div><p cla