l\\\">The Cajas Digital Agency</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/www.cajasdigital.com__;!!COskAx4!EujgAGgL3dsf-dVjqoHW3Q_bTzzmzqHI3OvdMz0kemH6rX9_W-GSCiOmyREXqZa-ho8XWee_kRbemqQcqF98ojHEf8hE$\\\">www.cajasdigital.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:Andrew@CajasDigital.com\\\">Andrew@CajasDigital.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">m.) 225.323.1120 (Text Friendly)</p></div></div><div id=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_mail-editor-reference-message-container\\\"><div style=\\\"border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in;border-color:currentcolor\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><b>From: </b>Spencer Lincoln &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:Spencer.Lincoln@scorpion.co\\\">Spencer.Lincoln@scorpion.co</a>&gt;<br /><b>Date: </b>Tuesday, June 16, 2026 at 2:37 PM<br /><b>To: </b>Jarrod Smith &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:jarrod@smithandvinson.com\\\">jarrod@smithandvinson.com</a>&gt;<br /><b>Cc: </b>Brad Vinson &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:brad@smithandvinson.com\\\">brad@smithandvinson.com</a>&gt;; Andrew Price &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:andrew@cajasdigital.com\\\">andrew@cajasdigital.com</a>&gt;<br /><b>Subject: </b>ChatGPT Ads</p></div></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Hey Guys,</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">As I’m sure you’ve heard, OpenAI has finally rolled out advertising for its product and the door’s now open for legal advertising.  With next month resuming the budget for PPC at $5k, it’d be a good opportunity for us to test the waters and see if we can generate some leads from that platform.</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">I’m going to have the team run a campaign next month with $2,000 in budget applied to it so that we can at the very least see what it produces for us.  I think it’ll certainly be much more cost effective than Google PPC, and over time could be a good produced of PI leads. </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">We’ll keep you posted. </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><table class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"width:307.5pt\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"width:335.25pt;padding:15.0pt 0in 15.0pt 0in\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><b>Spencer Lincoln</b></p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">Senior Director of Account Management</p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"line-height:11.5pt\\\"> <a href=\\\"mailto:Spencer.Lincoln@scorpion.co\\\">Spencer.Lincoln@scorpion.co</a></p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"line-height:11.5pt\\\"> <a href=\\\"tel:661%20568%207647\\\">661 568 7647</a></p></div><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"line-height:11.5pt\\\"> <a href=\\\"https://www.scorpion.co/\\\">www.scorpion.co</a></p></div></td><td style=\\\"width:.5in;padding:15.0pt 0in 15.0pt 0in\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.scorpion.co/\\\"></a></p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;border-color:currentcolor\\\"><table class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"width:100.0%\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"width:210.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\\\"><div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\">27770 Entertainment Drive, Suite 200, Valencia, CA 91355</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p class=\\\"x_x_x_x_x_MsoNormal\\\"> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div>\"},\"sender\":{\"name\":\"Brad Vinson\",\"address\":\"brad@smithandvinson.com\"},\"toRecipients\":[{\"name\":\"Joseph Cajas\",\"address\":\"jrcajas@cajasdigital.com\"},{\"name\":\"Spence