[2026-06-17 22:31:18] [claude-sdk] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016sUY1pmYxodb2c93i4MLuj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the full **ChatGPT Ads** thread, in chronological order:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Spencer Lincoln (June 16, 2:37 PM) - Original message\nOpenAI has rolled out advertising and legal advertising is now open. With the Smith & Vinson PPC budget resuming next month at $5k, Spencer wants to allocate **$2,000 to test ChatGPT ads**. He expects it to be more cost-effective than Google PPC for personal injury leads.\n\n### 2. You (June 16, 3:17 PM)\nLooped in Joseph. \"Thanks for the info Spencer.\"\n\n### 3. Joseph Cajas (June 16, ~3:39 PM)\n\"Thanks for sharing. We will circle back on this as we have been deeply engaged on AI. Before we redirect any of the budget let us talk with Brad and Jarrod. Andrew is best to ask however what steps have been included to prep the website to stay forward on the AI initiative.\"\n\n### 4. Spencer Lincoln (June 16, ~3:41 PM)\n\"We'd be among the first in the door on running ads on this channel in this market, so this should be an absolute go in my opinion.\"\n\n### 5. You (June 16, ~4:13 PM)\nAgreed ChatGPT Ads are exciting but pumped the brakes: \"Before reallocating budget, we'd like to connect with Brad and Jarrod to make sure it aligns with the broader strategy.\" Emphasized that the bigger opportunity is ensuring the website, content, tracking, and digital foundation are properly positioned first.\n\n### 6. Spencer Lincoln (June 17, 5:22 PM)\n\"Happy to discuss any of this, just let me know when's a good time.\"\n\n### 7. Joseph Cajas (June 17, 5:32 PM)\n\"Brad and Jarrod what works for you guys. I know we have 1-2 meetings tomorrow that we can't move but aside from that we can work out anything.\"\n\n### 8. Brad Vinson (June 17, 6:28 PM)\n\"Tomorrow at 3 or 4. Friday morning or Monday afternoon.\"\n\n### 9. Spencer Lincoln (June 17, 8:32 PM)\n\"I can do tomorrow at 3.\"\n\n### 10. Joseph Cajas (June 17, 8:40 PM)\n**\"Let's lock in 3 tomorrow\"**\n\n### 11. Brad Vinson (June 17, 8:47 PM)\n\"Sounds good.\"\n\n### 12. Spencer Lincoln (June 17, 8:47 PM)\n\"We can meet on my zoom: **scorpion.co/spencer**\"\n\n### 13. Brad Vinson (June 17, 8:53 PM)\n\"Perfect. See y'all then.\"\n\n---\n\n**Bottom line:** You have a call today (June 18) at **3:00 PM** on Spencer's Zoom (scorpion.co/spencer) to discuss ChatGPT Ads strategy for Smith & Vinson. Attendees: Joseph, Spencer, Brad, Jarrod, Jasetin, and you.\n\nSpencer also sent a separate follow-up email at ~9:01 PM with subject **\"Call w/Spencer\"** which likely has the Zoom link again."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22479,"cache_read_input_tokens":23310,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22479},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd62e171-2846-4932-ad50-1514b2842693","uuid":"3646d46f-6137-4d19-8158-ff1abcf6fdb4"}
