[2026-06-17 22:35:28] [claude-sdk] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GRozXSvmFxL3iqBMeAikpo","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725937391\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725937391\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:52:17.391Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>which means they would need that kind of content on the website- which they should be doing anyhow like the big dogs are</p>\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725915253\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725915253\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:51:55.253Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>they dont say- its just educational ads as the only way around ot</p>\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725892500\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725892500\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:51:32.5Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p><img src=\\\"https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/chats/19:822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb@thread.v2/messages/1781725892500/hostedContents/aWQ9eF8wLWN1cy1kMTAtNjUyYjA0NDdiYWIxNDFlYTE5NDY2NTg1MjZkMWYzMzYsdHlwZT0xLHVybD1odHRwczovL3VzLWFwaS5hc20uc2t5cGUuY29tL3YxL29iamVjdHMvMC1jdXMtZDEw...\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725664827\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725664827\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:47:44.827Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>yes, im just telling them chatgpt technically announced last week legal services are paused. existing accounts can submit for manual review approval and we will need to have scorpion make a bunch of educational content on the website for us to be able to run that kind of chatg...\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725500987\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725500987\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Joseph Cajas\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:45:00.987Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<div>Jasetin are you ready for the 4 pm call? Andrew are you ready to talk through Victoria email about the website removal<br>\\nIssue? I think jasetin and Andrew one of you address adding leadsbridge to streamline lead delivery while they pick out crm</div>\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725718894\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725718894\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Andrew Price\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:48:38.894Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>How long are legal services paused for?</p>\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781725673782\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781725673782\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T19:47:53.782Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>unless its hiding somewhere i couldn't see</p>\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"1781696255121\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3