 call..also what the website needs for it to readyt to optimize the search...could them beign on yelp help this traffic in chat?</p>\"}\n{\"id\":\"1781694409695\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781694409695\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Joseph Cajas\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T11:06:49.695Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>boom!</p>\"}\n{\"id\":\"1781694202500\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781694202500\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T11:03:22.5Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>ok. and yes,, we are the only ones that have an approval for them anyway. we used their EIN remember - scorpian couldnt if they tried</p>\"}\n{\"id\":\"1781694160601\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781694160601\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Joseph Cajas\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T11:02:40.601Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"Yes. We are going to get on a call with them today to discuss. I’ll forward the email so you can see all the conversation in here\"}\n{\"id\":\"1781694117862\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781694117862\",\"messageType\":\"message\",\"eventDetail\":null,\"subject\":null,\"summary\":null,\"from\":\"Jasetin McPherson\",\"createdDateTime\":\"2026-06-17T11:01:57.862Z\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"webUrl\":null,\"bodyPreview\":\"<p>for chatgpt?&nbsp;</p>\"}\n{\"id\":\"1781693785253\",\"uri\":\"teams:///chats/19%3A822ca2b24775479d8b163c49a67ebceb%40thread.v2/messages/1781693785253\",\"messageType\":\"message\"