[2026-06-17 22:36:00] [claude-sdk] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015bziTwJ57ZykFYUFp11eV2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found two group chats. The larger one with the full leadership team (Joseph, Victoria, Lita, Caleb, Kiandra, and you) looks like the main CDA leadership chat. Here are the most recent messages, newest first:\n\n---\n\n### June 17 (yesterday/today)\n\n**Victoria Taunton** (6:31 PM)\n@Lita Box - New contact for KSAT to replace Sharon Lepere: **Don Davis** (ddavis@ksat.com)\n\n**Andrew Price** (2:32 PM)\n\"Thank ya ma'am. I'll start moving over what I have\"\n\n**Victoria Taunton** (2:31 PM)\nIPA has been added to the assets folders in each category on SharePoint. If anyone needs a link, let her know.\n\n**Joseph Cajas** (2:29 PM)\n\"There you go. Send that @Lita Box please\"\n\n**Victoria Taunton** (2:22 PM)\nHats billing update: 1st + 2nd purchase being billed together. Total for hats: **$3,820.82 + CC processing fee**.\n\n**Joseph Cajas** (2:00 PM)\n\"Lita please send to him. You're the voice to him on this and we don't need another contact connecting with him on the hats.\" / \"Vic send to Lita a layout for her to share please\"\n\n**Lita Box** (1:59 PM)\n\"He approved the design & quantity, you just need to send him the total cost that we charge with up charges\"\n\n**Victoria Taunton** (1:49 PM)\n\"@Lita Box did brad approve the 2nd hats order already?\"\n\n---\n\n### June 15 (Sunday)\n\n**Joseph Cajas** (11:04 PM)\n🎉 **\"It's official team...IPA signed their agreement and we are their official agency on record. LFG!!! Great job everyone. Now the heavy lifting starts. Everyone please get your assignments to Andrew asap.\"**\n\n**Victoria Taunton** (11:07 PM)\n\"Whoo hoo! Go team!!!\"\n\n**Andrew Price** (10:34 PM)\n\"@Victoria Taunton Scorpion got back and said they removed that logo. I also just went through the website to confirm and it appears to be gone. Please check the website, make sure you don't see it either and then resubmit to the bar.\"\n\n**Victoria Taunton** (6:57 PM)\nTX State Bar application for Smith & Vinson social media ad copy has been **deferred** pending website approval. The issue: need to remove the Texas State Bar seal from attorney pages on the website (Brad's page and Jessica Huynh's page).\n\n---\n\n**Key takeaways:**\n1. **IPA is officially signed** - assignments need to go to you ASAP\n2. **Smith & Vinson** - TX State Bar issue resolved (Scorpion removed the seal), Victoria needs to resubmit\n3. **Hats order** for a client - Brad approved, Lita handling communication, total ~$3,820\n4. **KSAT contact change** - Don Davis replaces Sharon Lepere\n\nThere's also a separate smaller chat (Joseph, Jasetin, you) with a lot of back-and-forth about the ChatGPT Ads situation for Smith & Vinson. Want me to pull that one too?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7747,"cache_read_input_tokens":49934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7747},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd62e171-2846-4932-ad50-1514b2842693","uuid":"3b72b285-5b99-4777-a5f5-e5f0c92e8d34"}
